[{"title":"Three Forces — The First Shoot","deck":"Forest, stone, the Icelandic coast. The first pictures TRIAD made as TRIAD — no stylist, no studio, no budget. Just the three of us, a camera and whatever was in the wardrobe.","category":"Fashion Editorials","date":"2026-11-17","author":"Photography & styling by the TRIAD Collective","issue":"004","cover":"/uploads/triad/forest-walk.jpg","featured":true,"find":["wide cargo shorts","military combat boots","m65 field jacket olive","distressed leather bomber jacket"],"gallery":["/uploads/triad/cover-maier-door.jpg","/uploads/triad/red-wall-smoke.jpg"],"slug":"three-forces-the-first-shoot","url":"/magazine/three-forces-the-first-shoot/","code":"TRD-MAG-004-01","readTime":1,"people":[],"html":"<p>One wall, three positions. That frame became the title of the issue before we had even named it: three forces, one direction.</p>\n<figure class=\"art-figure art-figure--bleed\" data-reveal>\n  <div class=\"frame\"><img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/three-forces-triptych.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Three positions in front of a sandstone wall\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/three-forces-triptych.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/three-forces-triptych.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/three-forces-triptych.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><span class=\"frame-code\">FIG. 01</span></div>\n  <figcaption>Three positions, one wall.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2 data-reveal>Forest</h2>\n<p>Late light, wet ground, boots that have walked further than we have. Nothing here was bought for the shoot — it is what we wear.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery gallery--3\" data-gallery data-reveal>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/forest-walk.jpg\" data-caption=\"Forest, late light.\" aria-label=\"Open image 1: Walking on a moss-covered wall in the forest\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/forest-walk.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Walking on a moss-covered wall in the forest\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/forest-walk.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/forest-walk.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/forest-walk.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 01</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Forest, late light.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/boots-cargo.jpg\" data-caption=\"Cargo, leather, moss.\" aria-label=\"Open image 2: Cargo shorts and worn leather boots against a tree\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/boots-cargo.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Cargo shorts and worn leather boots against a tree\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/boots-cargo.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/boots-cargo.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/boots-cargo.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 02</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Cargo, leather, moss.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/cover-maier-door.jpg\" data-caption=\"One body, three exposures.\" aria-label=\"Open image 3: Standing in front of a wooden door, two motion ghosts at the sides\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/cover-maier-door.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Standing in front of a wooden door, two motion ghosts at the sides\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/cover-maier-door.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/cover-maier-door.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/cover-maier-door.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 03</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>One body, three exposures.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<h2 data-reveal>Stone &amp; street</h2>\n<p>Corrugated metal, sandstone, a red wall nobody repainted. The city as a backdrop that doesn't ask for attention.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery gallery--4\" data-gallery data-reveal>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/field-jacket-profile.jpg\" data-caption=\"Field jacket, side.\" aria-label=\"Open image 1: Olive field jacket in profile against corrugated metal\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/field-jacket-profile.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Olive field jacket in profile against corrugated metal\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/field-jacket-profile.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/field-jacket-profile.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/field-jacket-profile.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 01</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Field jacket, side.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/triad-banner.jpg\" data-caption=\"TRIAD, vertical.\" aria-label=\"Open image 2: Leaning against a stone wall next to a red TRIAD banner\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/triad-banner.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Leaning against a stone wall next to a red TRIAD banner\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/triad-banner.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/triad-banner.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/triad-banner.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 02</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>TRIAD, vertical.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/red-wall-smoke.jpg\" data-caption=\"Red wall.\" aria-label=\"Open image 3: Smoking in front of a red wall\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/red-wall-smoke.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Smoking in front of a red wall\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/red-wall-smoke.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/red-wall-smoke.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/red-wall-smoke.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 03</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Red wall.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/barn-door-denim.jpg\" data-caption=\"Barn door.\" aria-label=\"Open image 4: Cap, wide grey jeans and a wallet chain in front of a red barn door\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/barn-door-denim.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Cap, wide grey jeans and a wallet chain in front of a red barn door\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/barn-door-denim.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/barn-door-denim.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/barn-door-denim.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 04</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Barn door.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/betreten-verboten.jpg\" data-caption=\"Betreten verboten.\" aria-label=\"Open image 5: Long sleeve with printed slogans, worn in front of ivy\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/betreten-verboten.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Long sleeve with printed slogans, worn in front of ivy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/betreten-verboten.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/betreten-verboten.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/betreten-verboten.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 05</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Betreten verboten.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<h2 data-reveal>North</h2>\n<p>Iceland: black sand, snow, a waterfall loud enough to end every conversation. The pixel hand — three fingers up — followed us there.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery gallery--4\" data-gallery data-reveal>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/iceland-hand.jpg\" data-caption=\"Three, raised.\" aria-label=\"Open image 1: Standing on black gravel next to a giant white pixel hand, glacier behind\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/iceland-hand.w1400.jpg\" alt=\"Standing on black gravel next to a giant white pixel hand, glacier behind\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/iceland-hand.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/iceland-hand.w1400.jpg 1400w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/iceland-hand.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 01</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Three, raised.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-05.jpg\" data-caption=\"Coast.\" aria-label=\"Open image 2: Red hood against grey sea and rock\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-05.jpg\" alt=\"Red hood against grey sea and rock\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-05.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-05.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 02</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Coast.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-02.jpg\" data-caption=\"Waterfall.\" aria-label=\"Open image 3: Waterfall portrait in a yellow frame\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-02.jpg\" alt=\"Waterfall portrait in a yellow frame\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-02.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-02.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 03</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Waterfall.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n  <button class=\"frame gallery-open\" type=\"button\" data-lightbox=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-03.jpg\" data-caption=\"Scale.\" aria-label=\"Open image 4: Small figure walking in front of a snow-covered mountain\">\n    <img src=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-03.jpg\" alt=\"Small figure walking in front of a snow-covered mountain\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-03.w800.jpg 800w, /Triad-/uploads/triad/post-15-7-26-03.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw\">\n    <span class=\"frame-code\">PL. 04</span>\n  </button>\n  <figcaption>Scale.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>"}]